WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.600
Pick a pixel-art wanderer to walk the mist with you.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:13.200
Tap Start wandering and go for a walk. The mist lifts wherever you walk, and your path stays on your phone.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:19.300
Your stats: how much of your town, your country and the world you have cleared. No accounts, no scores.
